{"id":"vod_bf_2333","vodId":"2333","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"宝石之国","name_cn":"宝石之国","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-3/74f25f313a2d69820e06822b58f9f77b.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在遥远的未来世界之中，地球上存在一种身体由宝石形成的宝石人形生命体，这种生命体自打一出现以来就经历着遭人掠夺的悲惨命运，如今，全世界仅剩下28人。来历不明的神秘种族“月人”出现开始掠夺宝石人，将他们残忍的制作成装饰品，不仅如此，甚至将他们加工成为武器。　　十分易碎又没有韧性的磷叶石（黑泽朋世 配音）、能够释放出银色毒液的辰砂（小松未可子 配音）、向往浪漫爱情故事的钻石（茅野爱衣 配音）、潜心于战斗的圆粒金刚石（佐仓绫音 配音）、个性活泼开朗的摩根石（田村睦心 配音），为了抵抗月人的入侵，世界上仅存的宝石人们决定联手。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 17:59:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241020erNlhO76index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241020UQ3N1c7Aindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/baoshizhiguo/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/baoshizhiguo/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241020MjpshlEyindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241020XrLFVfryindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241020J50xxjHQindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241020Yi37bHXlindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241020bPlmeupiindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/baoshizhiguo/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202410209AjD41Wdindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202410206W